We built a predictive ball-tracking engine that calls a point (ball out, or into the net) before the ball lands: on
held-out table tennis it called << V('cv.eng.tp') >> of << V('cv.eng.nmiss') >> misses a median
<< V('cv.eng.lead') >>\,ms early, none wrong, at << V('cv.eng.fps') >>\,fps, and on broadcast tennis its out calls were
