<< V('univ.matches') >> Polymarket ATP/WTA matches, wallets that trade within 3\,s of a point earn after fees in all
<< V('ft.months.cal') >> months. Copying them at their own fills (v2) has a Sharpe ratio of << V('v2.is.sr') >> in sample
and << V('v2.oos.sr') >> out of sample (many small, nearly independent bets; Section~\ref{sec:summary});
doubled fees erase it out of sample. A simulated computer-vision (CV) trader with an assumed 1\,s feed makes
